('sentencias-tc-completas-2026-TC-2026-PA-04068-LIMA-CERROVERDE', 'sentencias-tc-completas-2026', 'Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde - Casación Laboral 5469 - Apartamiento precedentes Demanda de amparo contra Casación Laboral 5469 de la Cuarta Sala Constitucional y Social Transitoria de la Corte Suprema. La Sala confirmó la improcedencia por estimar que la pretensión busca reabrir el análisis de fondo del proceso laboral ya resuelto, lo cual excede el ámbito del amparo (art. 7.1 CPC). Aplicación del art. 22 del TUO de la LOPJ para apartamiento de precedentes.  ', '[0.13333334,0.02745098,0.65882355,0.49803922,0.8627451,0.22352941,0.28627452,0.2627451,0.45490196,0.50980395,0.3019608,0.45490196,0.26666668,0.06666667,0.7058824,0.08627451,0.8,0.67058825,0.8509804,0.57254905,0.29803923,0.8627451,0.047058824,0.48235294,0.5176471,0.6745098,0.0627451,0.8039216,0.95686275,0.20392157,0.8980392,0.14117648,0.25882354,0.15294118,0.78431374,0.62352943,0.9882353,0.34901962,0.4117647,0.3882353,0.5803922,0.63529414,0.42745098,0.5803922,0.39215687,0.19215687,0.83137256,0.21176471,0.9254902,0.79607844,0.9764706,0.69803923,0.42352942,0.9882353,0.17254902,0.60784316,0.6431373,0.8,0.1882353,0.92941177,0.078431375,0.32941177,0.019607844,0.26666668,0.38431373,0.2784314,0.9098039,0.7490196,0.10980392,0.4745098,0.5372549,0.5137255,0.7058824,0.7607843,0.5529412,0.7058824,0.5176471,0.31764707,0.95686275,0.3372549,0.047058824,0.92156863,0.09803922,0.8235294,0.54901963,0.10980392,0.29803923,0.73333335,0.76862746,0.9254902,0.3137255,0.050980393,0.20392157,0.45490196,0.14509805,0.39215687,0.50980395,0.40392157,0.03137255,0.8745098,0.23529412,0.6,0.6627451,0.6392157,0.83137256,0.8862745,0.6784314,0.83137256,0.6431373,0.44313726,0.078431375,0.4627451,0.17254902,0.043137256,0.22352941,0.9490196,0.6745098,0.23529412,0.42352942,0.85882354,0.89411765,0.047058824,0.4392157,0.1764706,0.32941177,0.5803922,0.27058825,0.5176471,0.63529414,0.5294118,0.15686275,1,0.36078432,0.7254902,0.7882353,0.7647059,0.95686275,0.