('sentencias-tc-completas-2026-TC-2026-PC-03599-LIMA-DEFENSA', 'sentencias-tc-completas-2026', 'Pensión invalidez - César Vallejo Cortez - Ministerio de Defensa Demanda de cumplimiento contra el Ministerio de Defensa. El TC aplica art. 7.3 del Nuevo Código Procesal Constitucional (causal de improcedencia cuando el agraviado haya recurrido previamente a otro proceso judicial para pedir tutela respecto a su derecho constitucional - STC 02881-2004-PA/TC, fundamento 3). El recurrente ya acudió a proceso contencioso-administrativo contra el Ejército del Perú sobre nulidad de Resolución Ministerial 1101-DE/EP/CP-JAPE y pensión de invalidez conforme al D.Ley 19846.  ', '[0.6666667,0.29411766,0.87058824,0.9490196,0.93333334,0.7372549,0.98039216,0.42745098,0.8862745,0.28627452,0.99607843,0.29411766,0.4745098,0.6901961,0.91764706,0.43529412,0.101960786,0.19215687,0.99215686,0.78039217,0.5058824,0.003921569,0.49411765,0.105882354,0.9490196,0.8117647,0.50980395,0.05882353,0.023529412,0.68235296,0.03529412,0.70980394,0.7921569,0.41960785,0.99607843,0.07058824,0.05490196,0.8627451,0.101960786,0.5529412,0.007843138,0.4117647,0.11764706,0.41960785,0.6,0.8156863,0.039215688,0.56078434,0.22745098,0.31764707,0.11372549,0.90588236,0.6313726,0.12941177,0.61960787,0.23137255,0.07058824,0.9372549,0.63529414,0.18431373,0.14901961,0.80784315,0.16078432,0.8352941,0.91764706,0.54509807,0.11764706,0.19607843,0.18039216,0.9882353,0.22745098,0.6784314,0.13333334,0.5372549,0.24313726,0.54509807,0.7254902,0.9411765,0.16470589,0.6862745,0.3529412,0.44313726,0.23921569,0.02745098,0.75686276,0.25490198,0.74509805,0.35686275,0.19607843,0.05882353,0.7607843,0.30980393,0.27450982,0.93333334,0.28627452,0.9607843,0.039215688,0.67058825,0.24313726,0.32156864,0.30588236,0.10980392,0.3529412,0.8039216,0.25882354,0.6627451,0.36862746,0.67058825,0.8509804,0.0627451,0.2901961,0.8117647,0.47843137,0.5686275,0.3647059,0.15294118,0.88235295,0.38039216,0.87058824,0.48235294,0.32156864,0.18431373,0.8862745,0.4352941