('sentencias-tc-completas-2026-TC-2026-PC-04335-PUNO', 'sentencias-tc-completas-2026', 'Eduardo Luján Urviola - Decano Facultad Odontología UANCV Demanda de cumplimiento contra UANCV para que se dé cumplimiento a la Resolución 011-2022-CEU/UANCV-J que nombró al recurrente como decano de la Facultad de Odontología tras ganar las elecciones del 18/11/2022. La universidad no lo ratificó argumentando falta de grado de maestro o doctor, pese a que SUNEDU (Informe 629-2022-SUNEDU-03-06) señaló que el grado de maestro o doctor en Educación es transversal a todas las especialidades.  ', '[0.6117647,0.1254902,0.2627451,0.011764706,0.21176471,0.39607844,0.99607843,0.8352941,0.0627451,0.33333334,0.007843138,0.80784315,0.8156863,0.5372549,0.30980393,0.98039216,0.32156864,0.24313726,0.18431373,0.13333334,0.84705883,0.76862746,0.52156866,0.58431375,0.1254902,0.57254905,0.5372549,0.80784315,0.30588236,0.09019608,0.23137255,0.9764706,0.7372549,0.2509804,0.3882353,0.13725491,0.3372549,0.52156866,0.11764706,0.9607843,0.1882353,0.45882353,0.13333334,0.93333334,0.9411765,0.6627451,0.43529412,0.101960786,0.44705883,0.36862746,0.30980393,0.25882354,0.972549,0.89411765,0.64705884,0.70980394,0.2509804,0.69803923,0.6627451,0.93333334,0.43137255,0.21568628,0.35686275,0.09803922,0.8627451,0.3764706,0.5137255,0.2627451,0.4627451,0.64705884,0.24313726,0.08235294,0.3137255,0.58431375,0.25882354,0.05490196,0.0627451,0.7882353,0.56078434,0.22745098,0.57254905,0.49411765,0.43529412,0.38431373,0.09411765,0.015686275,0.77254903,0.8352941,0.3764706,0.8235294,0.7882353,0.05490196,0.5568628,0.34117648,0.48235294,0.22352941,0.9882353,0.5019608,0.6392157,0.3882353,0.5882353,0.77254903,0.36862746,0.20784314,0.4392157,0.70980394,0.38431373,0.18039216,0.1882353,0.9137255,0.6862745,0.3529412,0.69803923,0.61960787,0.56078434,0.50980395,0.21960784,0.14117648,0.8980392,0.9607843,0.5019608,0.9490196,0.9137255,0.18039216,0.68235296,0.46666667,0.60784316,0.34901962,0.10980392,0.627451,0.7647059,0.5137255,0.7137255,