('sentencias-tc-completas-2026-TC-2026-PHC-04252-AREQUIPA', 'sentencias-tc-completas-2026', 'Sustracción de menor A.B.H.C. por su padre Habeas corpus a favor de menor A.B.H.C. contra su padre por sustracción de la menor de su centro educativo. Madre solicita entrega inmediata. El TC establece que la controversia subyace en un asunto de familia (tenencia) que corresponde al juez de familia, no al juez constitucional; el extremo de educación no puede ser conexo a la libertad personal si esta no se ha acreditado.  ', '[0.36862746,0.56078434,0.8039216,0.007843138,0.13333334,0.53333336,0.8627451,0.7764706,0.8745098,0.15686275,0.8784314,0.4,0.87058824,0.16862746,0.8509804,0.039215688,0.8862745,0.78431374,0.7411765,0.44705883,0.9019608,0.9411765,0.49803922,0.6156863,0.9372549,0.18431373,0.5137255,0.5176471,0.22745098,0.7647059,0.7882353,0.34901962,0.49411765,0.6862745,0.92941177,0.13333334,0.25882354,0.65882355,0.9882353,0.9019608,1,0.28235295,0,0.5254902,0.99607843,0.29411766,0.9764706,0.16470589,0.007843138,0.9098039,0.8666667,0.57254905,0.023529412,0.0627451,0.62352943,0.7411765,0.05882353,0.30980393,0.6392157,0.6431373,0.3529412,0.8901961,0.9137255,0.4745098,0.61960787,0.8117647,0.050980393,0.25882354,0.38431373,0.78431374,0.10980392,0.023529412,0.12156863,0.40784314,0.1254902,0.6509804,0.11764706,0.41960785,0.09803922,0.2901961,0.13333334,0.03137255,0.99215686,0.69803923,0.14901961,0.1882353,0.7490196,0.8666667,0.18431373,0.43529412,0.7647059,0.76862746,0.47843137,0.011764706,0.03529412,0.6,0.74509805,0.9372549,0.1764706,0.38431373,0.50980395,0.9098039,0.23529412,0.14901961,0.24705882,0.53333336,0.2509804,0.7764706,0.24313726,0.54509807,0.22352941,0.41568628,0.25882354,0.15686275,0.11372549,0.8235294,0.27450982,0.3137255,0.8745098,0.99215686,0.30980393,0.56078434,0.8901961,0.89411765,0.6039216,0.13725491,0.16078432,0.7254902,0.87058824,0.05882353,0.3019608,0.50980395,0.63529414,0.03137255,0.36078432,0.27450982,0.37254903,0.65882355,0.3764706,0.9019608,0.36862746,0.670