('sentencias-tc-completas-2026-TC-2026-PHC-05628-TUMBES', 'sentencias-tc-completas-2026', 'Detención arbitraria antidrogas - Andair Carrasco Alva y Steward Morán Lloclla Habeas corpus por detención arbitraria de dos personas el 24/07/2024 por personal antidrogas de Piura mientras realizaban labores agrícolas en Tumbes. Alegaron maltratos y vulneración de centro de trabajo. La Sala Penal de Apelaciones de Tumbes confirmó sentencia que declaró improcedente por sustracción de la materia (luego se dictó prisión preventiva por hallazgo de cannabis sativa).  ', '[0.63529414,0.23137255,0.8039216,0.8392157,0.33333334,0.27058825,0.7607843,0.99215686,0.67058825,0.63529414,0.7764706,0.11764706,0.54901963,0.38431373,0.8509804,0.05490196,0.972549,0.84313726,0.3019608,0.05490196,0.5803922,0.6392157,0.8156863,0.12941177,0.73333335,0.827451,0.83137256,0.80784315,0.42745098,0.5568628,0.34901962,0.4509804,0.7607843,0.35686275,0.92941177,0.9647059,0.45882353,0.39607844,0.8862745,0.11372549,0.79607844,0.7607843,0.9019608,0.24313726,0.6745098,0.50980395,0.9764706,0.18039216,0.09411765,0.96862745,0.42745098,0.18039216,0.7058824,0.7647059,0.9411765,0.25490198,0.85882354,0.9529412,0.95686275,0.93333334,0.5529412,0.68235296,0.4745098,0.5764706,0.8862745,0.48235294,0.050980393,0.08627451,0.58431375,0.52156866,0.007843138,0.23921569,0.92156863,0.8862745,0.023529412,0.36862746,0.8,0.63529414,0.09803922,0.30588236,0.21960784,0.09019608,0.5529412,0.30588236,0.83137256,0.8901961,0.0627451,0.38039216,0.9843137,0.07450981,0.078431375,0.05490196,0.6784314,0.80784315,0.6,0.7019608,0.007843138,0.60784316,0.1764706,0.21176471,0.70980394,0.64705884,0.13333334,0.3647059,0.043137256,0.007843138,0.14901961,0.49411765,0.9254902,0.7607843,0.22352941,0.43137255,0.34509805,0.21568628,0.6784314,0.43137255,0.95686275,0.011764706,0.1882353,0.5058824,0.105882354,0.2,0.20392157,0.18039216,0.8039216,0.93333334,0.7254902,0.827451,0.13333334,0.73333335,0.3019608,0.3372549,0.8352941,0.77254903,0.25882354,0.49019608,0.1